    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">06 / Free resource, no email required</p><h2>From profile<br>to first call.</h2><p>Copy this brief into your CRM notes or working document. Fill it in for the next account, then update the last line after the call.</p></div>
    <div class="sn-brief-layout"><div><pre id="sn-brief-text" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reusable prospect-to-call brief">{{ guide.briefText }}</pre><button class="lp-button" type="button" id="sn-copy-brief" hidden>Copy the prospect brief</button><p id="sn-copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><noscript><p class="lp-small">Select and copy the brief above. It works without an account or form.</p></noscript></div><aside><h3>Example notes for the caller.</h3><p><strong>Buyer:</strong> office manager at a business inside our cleaning service area. Confirm who owns the contract.</p><p><strong>Fit and issue:</strong> office premises we can service. Ask when they next review the cleaning arrangement.</p><p><strong>Route:</strong> published office number, checked against the company website today. Record the actual number and source in the CRM.</p><p><strong>Question:</strong> “Who looks after the cleaning contract for your office?”</p><p><strong>Next action:</strong> assigned caller contacts the office during its working hours, then logs the outcome and any agreed callback.</p></aside></div>
